Build this UI to visually match the existing Unified Platform (Electron) design system exactly. Do not invent a new visual language. Use the same colors, typography, spacing, radii, shadows, borders, and component patterns described below. Light mode only. No dark theme. No purple-to-indigo marketing gradients. No Tailwind purple defaults. Prefer vanilla CSS or CSS variables that mirror these tokens.

═══════════════════════════════════════
1) DESIGN TOKENS (CSS VARIABLES)
═══════════════════════════════════════

:root {
  /* Neutrals (Slate scale) */
  --base-0: #f8fafc;   /* page background */
  --base-1: #f1f5f9;   /* soft secondary surface */
  --base-2: #e2e8f0;   /* default borders / dividers */
  --base-3: #cbd5e1;   /* stronger borders, scrollbar */
  --base-4: #94a3b8;   /* muted controls */
  --base-5: #64748b;   /* muted icons / secondary text edge */

  /* Text */
  --text-strong: #0f172a;  /* primary text / body */
  --text-main: #1e293b;    /* secondary strong text */
  --text-muted: #475569;   /* hints, descriptions, idle labels */

  /* Brand / chrome */
  --primary-color: #1e104e; /* deep purple-navy brand */
  --btn-bg: #1e104e;
  --btn-bg-hover: #180d40;
  --btn-bg-active: #140a36;
  --brand-blue: #1764e8;   /* primary CTA blue */

  /* Layout chrome heights */
  --titlebar-height: 30px;
  --subnav-height: 32px;
}

Hard-coded chrome colors (also required):
- Title bar background: #0d2a63
- Title bar bottom border: #0a1f52
- Title bar title text: #ffffff, 12px, weight 600
- Title bar context/subtitle: #d8e5ff, 11px
- Title bar settings button: rgba(255,255,255,0.09) bg, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) border; hover 0.2 / 0.45
- Soft blue surfaces: #f8fbff, #eef4ff, #e8f0ff, #eef5ff, #eaf2ff, #eef3fb
- Soft blue borders/dividers: #d7dde8, #d6deea, #dbe4f0, #d8e0ef, #d9e2f1, #dbe2ec
- Active navy text/links: #0f2f7a
- White surfaces: #ffffff

═══════════════════════════════════════
2) TYPOGRAPHY
═══════════════════════════════════════

- UI font stack: "Inter", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
- Code / logs mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace
  (streams/diffs may use: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace)
- Body text color: var(--text-strong)
- Section labels (panel h3 style):
  11px, weight 700, letter-spacing 0.08em, text-transform uppercase, color #334155
- Settings page title: 20px / 700 / letter-spacing -0.02em
- Settings panel title: 15px / 700
- Body / hints: 12–13px, weights 400–600, muted color var(--text-muted)
- Micro labels, pills, badges: 9–11px, weight 600–800, often uppercase with letter-spacing 0.04–0.08em
- Log stream: 12px, line-height 1.4
- Common line-heights: 1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.35, 1.4, 1.45, 1.5, 1.55
- Headings h2/h3 default weight 600; margin bottom ~10px

═══════════════════════════════════════
3) SPACING SCALE (use these px steps)
═══════════════════════════════════════

Tight: 4, 5, 6, 8, 10
Medium: 12, 14, 16, 18
Large: 24, 36

Conventions:
- Main layout padding: 8px 10px 10px
- Default panel padding: 14px
- Settings main pane padding: 16px 18px 20px
- Settings field gap: 14px between fields; 6px label→control
- Modal outer padding ~24px; header 12px 16px; body 14px 16px
- Splash card: margin 16vh auto; padding 36px

═══════════════════════════════════════
4) RADIUS, BORDERS, SHADOWS
═══════════════════════════════════════

Radius scale:
- 4px: tiny badges / titlebar chips
- 6px: small success controls / tags
- 7px: default buttons, header tabs, nav items
- 8px: inputs, selects, pipeline items
- 10px: panels, textareas, callouts, settings cards
- 12px: modal panels
- 16px: splash cards
- 50%: status rings / knobs / spinners
- 999px: pills, badges, scrollbar thumb, toggle tracks

Borders:
- Default: 1px solid var(--base-2) or var(--base-3)
- Empty states: 1px dashed var(--base-3)
- Emphasized cards sometimes 1.5px–2px

Shadows:
- Splash: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06)
- Panel: 0 1px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05)
- Modal: 0 18px 48px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18)
- Hairline: 0 1px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04)
- Toggle knob: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15)
- Modal backdrop: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45)

Focus rings:
- Textarea: 0 0 0 3px rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18)
- Settings input: border #3b82f6 + 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2)
- Toggle: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35)

═══════════════════════════════════════
5) BACKGROUNDS & SURFACES
═══════════════════════════════════════

- Page background: var(--base-0) (#f8fafc)
- Main content / cards: #ffffff
- Secondary panes / streams: #f8fafc
- Soft info surface: #f8fbff
- Terminal/log dark body ONLY when needed: bg #0f172a, text #e2e8f0
- No background images/patterns as primary atmosphere
- Scrollbar: thin 6px; thumb gradient linear-gradient(180deg, --base-3, --base-4); radius 999px; no arrow buttons

