═══════════════════════════════════════

- App shell: fixed title bar (30px, navy) + content height calc(100vh - 30px)
- Optional subnav: 32px white bar with bottom border --base-2
- Prefer CSS Grid + Flexbox
- Typical 3-column workspace feel (if applicable):
  minmax(290px, 23%) | minmax(540px, 59%) | minmax(220px, 18%); gap 10px
- Settings layout: sidebar minmax(260px, 300px) + 1fr
- Splash max-width: 560px, centered
- Modals: min(920px, 96vw) / min(560px, 96vw); max-height ~70–82vh; radius 12px
- Settings inputs max-width: 520px
