═══════════════════════════════════════
7) COMPONENTS
═══════════════════════════════════════

PANELS / CARDS
- .panel: white bg, 1px solid --base-2, radius 10px, padding 14px, shadow 0 1px 6px rgba(15,23,42,0.05)
- Settings panels: similar; sometimes padding 14px 16px 16px
- Pipeline / info items: bg #f8fbff, radius 8px
- Callouts: soft tinted bg + matching border (see semantic colors)

BUTTONS (base)
- border 1px solid transparent; radius 7px; padding 9px 12px; font-weight 600
- transition: all 0.15s ease
- hover: filter brightness(0.97)
- disabled: opacity 0.55; cursor not-allowed

Button variants:
- Primary: bg/border --brand-blue (#1764e8), text #fff
- Secondary: bg #fff, border #cbd5e1, text #1e293b; hover bg #f8fafc
- Success: bg/border #0f766e, text #fff (often radius 6px, pad 8px)
- Danger: bg/border #b91c1c, text #fff
- Warning/amber CTA: bg #d97706, border #b45309, text #fff; hover #b45309
- Soft success (review): bg rgba(24,204,90,0.34), border rgba(2,36,15,0.53), text #166534
- Soft danger (review): bg rgba(220,38,38,0.12), border rgba(220,38,38,0.56), text #b91c1c
- Settings primary: #2563eb / hover #1d4ed8, radius 8px, pad 8px 16px
- Settings secondary: white, border #93c5fd, text #1e40af; hover #eff6ff
- Settings danger outline: white, border #fca5a5, text #b91c1c; hover #fef2f2
- Report/download chip: bg #eff6ff, border #bfdbfe, text #1d4ed8, ~11px

TABS / NAV
- Header tabs: idle bg #f8fafc text #475569; active bg #e8f0ff border #bdd0f6 text #0f2f7a; radius 7px
- Settings nav item: radius 7px, pad 7px 8px; hover #eef5ff/#d4e3ff; active #dbeafe/#93c5fd text #0f2f7a
- Settings group title: 11px / 800 / uppercase / #0f2f7a

INPUTS
- Textarea: full width, radius 10px, border 1px solid --base-2, padding 12px, bg #fff
- Select/input: radius 8px, padding ~7–10px, border #dbe2ec or #cbd5e1, 13px font
- Suggested/info select state: border #93c5fd, bg #f8fbff
- Disabled: opacity ~0.6
- Toggle: track 42×24 (compact 36×20); off #cbd5e1; on #3b82f6; white knob
- Radio/option cards checked: bg #eaf2ff, border #0f2f7a

PILLS / STATUS BADGES
- Idle: text #475569, border #dbe2ec, bg #f8fafc
- Ready/info: text #1e40af, border #bfdbfe, bg #eff6ff
- Running/warn: text #92400e, border #fcd34d, bg #fef3c7
- Success pipeline: text #166534, border #86efac, bg #f0fdf4 / #dcfce7
- Failed pipeline: text #991b1b, border #fca5a5, bg #fef2f2 / #fee2e2
- Milestone dots: in-progress #facc15, completed #22c55e, failed #ef4444
- Radius 999px for pills

LOG LEVEL COLORS
- Info: left #0ea5e9; badge #0369a1 / #e0f2fe / #7dd3fc
- Warning: left #d97706; badge #9a3412 / #ffedd5 / #fdba74
- Error: left #dc2626; badge #991b1b / #fee2e2 / #fca5a5
- Success: left #16a34a; badge #14532d / #dcfce7 / #86efac

DIFF COLORS
- Addition: text #166534, bg #dcfce7
- Deletion: text #991b1b, bg #fee2e2

═══════════════════════════════════════
8) VISUAL CHARACTER (MUST MATCH)
═══════════════════════════════════════

- Clean enterprise SaaS / engineering-tool look
- Cool slate neutrals + navy chrome + bright brand blue CTAs
- Dense but readable; lots of 11–13px UI text
- Uppercase micro-labels with wide letter-spacing for section headers
- Soft blue-tinted panels (#f8fbff) for “active workspace” areas
- Subtle shadows only (almost flat cards)
- Consistent 7–10px corner radii (not overly rounded)
- Prefer left-aligned content, tight vertical rhythm, flex headers with actions on the right
- Transitions short (~0.15s ease), no flashy motion
- Do not use Inter as a Google Font CDN requirement if local stack fallback is fine; keep the same font-family string

