9) IMPLEMENTATION RULES
═══════════════════════════════════════

1. Recreate the look using the tokens and component specs above before inventing new colors.
2. If a new component is needed, derive it from existing panel/button/input/pill patterns.
3. Keep light-only UI.
4. Primary actions = #1764e8; destructive = #b91c1c; success = #0f766e / green soft tints; warning = amber #d97706.
5. Page bg must be #f8fafc; cards/panels white with #e2e8f0 borders.
6. Title/chrome bars (if present) must use #0d2a63 navy, not generic gray headers.
